Dear Bob,

please replace "drinkingbeh" in the "interaction1=..." option by the 
name of the network (which is the common interaction1-value for the 
average alter effect) - this should work.

For these kinds of application questions, actually the other discussion 
forum is the good one:
https://groups.yahoo.com/neo/groups/stocnet/info

Please reserve this one for software programming related issues!
All the best,
Christian


